    "W00 owns public declarations; W producers implement them without silent signature changes.",
    "Each C1-C9 entry has one accountable owner; additional_producers do not create duplicate state ownership.",
    "The terrain owner outlives bound immutable query views; each hot mutable scratch owner is confined to one runtime context.",
    "Reference/candidate bitwise comparisons require the same platform, compiler, provider, engine and execution artifact.",
    "Zero checks, unavailable payloads, null required identities and unknown mandatory fields fail closed.",
